    "name": "Burial Stone",
    "steam_appid": 1910360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/7d736a62cd0937d10582e65b3d1ec020.poster.avif?t=1741622360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/7d736a62cd0937d10582e65b3d1ec020.webm?t=1741622360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/7d736a62cd0937d10582e65b3d1ec020.mp4?t=1741622360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i><strong>Delve into a damp dark dungeon, with your torch as your only light source, in Burial Stone.</strong></i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/09635981da7067bac1cb91406a9e7aeb.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2>Burial Stone is a VR or monitor tile based, tactical dungeon crawl. <br>Fight terrifying monsters from a first person perspective, acquire equipment, weapons and gold.<br>Learn spells and skills, gain XP, level up and improve your abilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/bd95721a93f8e52eb5c29896fd68afb9.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2>The combat is &quot;you move, the others move with you&quot; tactical style combat, reminiscent of a rogue like game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/0aa6cd9b5457bbd41cb66c1c0f1ec29c.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Atmosphere</h2>There is a sense of horror to these dungeons with some surprises along the way. Tread carefully.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/ca2230ade93bfb5fb2fadbe5ef1ad287.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div><br><br>How to launch non VR?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/a5e1627a6abadcd2728ae14d89b76db0.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/7d736a62cd0937d10582e65b3d1ec020.poster.avif?t=1741622360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/7d736a62cd0937d10582e65b3d1ec020.webm?t=1741622360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/7d736a62cd0937d10582e65b3d1ec020.mp4?t=1741622360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i><strong>Delve into a damp dark dungeon, with your torch as your only light source, in Burial Stone.</strong></i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/09635981da7067bac1cb91406a9e7aeb.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2>Burial Stone is a VR or monitor tile based, tactical dungeon crawl. <br>Fight terrifying monsters from a first person perspective, acquire equipment, weapons and gold.<br>Learn spells and skills, gain XP, level up and improve your abilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/bd95721a93f8e52eb5c29896fd68afb9.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2>The combat is &quot;you move, the others move with you&quot; tactical style combat, reminiscent of a rogue like game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/0aa6cd9b5457bbd41cb66c1c0f1ec29c.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Atmosphere</h2>There is a sense of horror to these dungeons with some surprises along the way. Tread carefully.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/ca2230ade93bfb5fb2fadbe5ef1ad287.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div><br><br>How to launch non VR?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910360/extras/a5e1627a6abadcd2728ae14d89b76db0.avif?t=1741622360\" /></div>",
